# GitHub shows the language with the most bytes, and the four ports here are within
# 900 bytes of each other — so the badge was decided by coincidence rather than by
# what the repo is about. Swift is the reference implementation and the subject is
# iOS, so everything else is marked undetectable to keep the label honest.
#
# This only affects the language badge and the stats bar. Nothing is hidden: the
# ports are still browsable, searchable and diffable as normal.
flutter/*      linguist-detectable=false
react-native/* linguist-detectable=false
tools/*        linguist-detectable=false
